# {{project}}

{{description}}

An application made with [Yuneta](https://github.com/artgins/yunetas):
its yunos live under `yunos/`, their configurations under `yunos/batches/`.

## Layout

```text
{{project}}/
    CMakeLists.txt          builds yunos/
    yunos/
        CMakeLists.txt      one add_subdirectory() per yuno
        batches/<host>/     the configurations of each node
```

## A new yuno

```bash
cd yunos
yuno-skeleton yuno_citizen          # asks for the role, then the rest
```

then add `add_subdirectory(<role>)` to `yunos/CMakeLists.txt`.

## Build

Register the project once, and the `yunetas` CLI builds it after the SDK:

```bash
yunetas register-project $PWD
yunetas build {{project}}
```

Or by hand:

```bash
mkdir -p yunos/build && cd yunos/build
cmake .. && make install
```

